{
    "title": "Freecash: Earn Money & Rewards",
    "description": "Play casual games and complete surveys for money with Freecash! Freecash is an easy-to-use game rewards app that lets you play games, win prizes, and earn rewards like gift cards, crypto, and more. Play casual games you love. take surveys, make money, and earn cash rewards all in one app with Freecash.\r\n\r\nWith Freecash you can make money by earning Bitcoin, Amazon gift cards, and more just by completing surveys or playing your favorite casual games. Best of all, the average Freecash user can earn around $17.53 per day with a first coin cash out after only 17 minutes and 16 seconds of playing. Prize play and epic game rewards are right around the corner when you sign up for Freecash!\r\n\r\nTake a survey on the go or play and win prizes as soon as you download. Make money with the fastest growing rewards website, now available through an easy-to-use app. Start making money straight from your phone and earn crypto, gift cards and more! Complete surveys and games for money conveniently with Freecash today.\r\n\r\nMoney games on Freecash are easy and fun! Play and earn with the best casual games, MMORPGs, sports games and just about every other genre available. Earn cash and crypto through amazing prize play when you play your favorite game and complete surveys for money.\r\n\r\nIt\u2019s easy to play and earn on Freecash. Here\u2019s how to get started:\r\n\r\n1. Download the Freecash app on the Playstore.\r\n2. Open the app and start your first task.\r\n3. Pick from a list of casual games to play or choose a money survey and earn rewards!\r\n4. Complete tasks and start making money. Some users earn more than $100 per day!\r\n5. Once you finish a task, go to the shop and choose your favorite reward.\r\n6. Cash out with PayPal, Bitcoin, gift cards & much more INSTANTLY!\r\n\r\nGet paid to play and test free games and apps or take a survey on the go and earn cash. Make money and earn rewards today with Freecash!\r\n\r\nFREECASH FEATURES\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfae PLAY AND EARN REWARDS \ud83c\udfae\r\n- Play and earn rewards in a variety of genres. From RPG, MMORPG, PvP games and more!\r\n- Play and win with a variety of casual games to make money.\r\n- Prize play with friends. Invite them to join Freecash with our affiliate program!\r\n- Earning commissions from your friends' game rewards once they join!\r\n\r\n\u2705TAKE PAID SURVEYS AND MAKE MONEY \u2705\r\n- Earn crypto and cash by completing paid surveys through one easy to use app.\r\n- Earn rewards for each paid survey when you cash out.\r\n- Take surveys for money from a variety of different companies.\r\n- Make money by answering questions and giving feedback. It\u2019s that simple!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfc6 EARN REWARDS WITH HIGH PAYOUTS \ud83c\udfc6\r\n- Earn cash instantly with free PayPal gift card cashouts through our Shop.\r\n- Rewards are just a few taps away with each task you complete.\r\n- Freecash runs promotions with your favorite apps to guarantee the best payout as you make money!\r\n- Top monthly users can earn rewards of up to $500 and daily amounts can go up to $100!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcb3 EARN REWARDS, GIFT CARDS & CRYPTOCURRENCY \ud83d\udcb3\r\n- EARN CRYPTO: Earn Bitcoin & other cryptocurrencies starting as low as only 10 cents!\r\n- GIFT CARDS FOR YOUR GAMES: Earn Play Store Gift Cards and easily load your account!\r\n- PAYPAL GIFT CARDS: Convert your balance to real cash!\r\n- AMAZON GIFT CARDS: Add your gift card to your Amazon account balance\r\n\r\nIf you need any help, you can always get in contact with our 24/7 online support.\r\n\r\nPlaying games for money? It\u2019s possible with Freecash! Download our rewards app to earn cash and crypto today!\r\n\r\nFor complete terms, privacy and services, please visit our website: https://freecash.com/terms\r\n\r\nEmail contact: support@freecash.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "Play casual games and complete surveys for money with Freecash! Freecash is an easy-to-use game rewards app that lets you play games, win prizes, and earn rewards like gift cards, crypto, and more. Play casual games you love. take surveys, make money, and earn cash rewards all in one app with Freecash.<br><br>With Freecash you can make money by earning Bitcoin, Amazon gift cards, and more just by completing surveys or playing your favorite casual games. Best of all, the average Freecash user can earn around $17.53 per day with a first coin cash out after only 17 minutes and 16 seconds of playing. Prize play and epic game rewards are right around the corner when you sign up for Freecash!<br><br>Take a survey on the go or play and win prizes as soon as you download. Make money with the fastest growing rewards website, now available through an easy-to-use app. Start making money straight from your phone and earn crypto, gift cards and more! Complete surveys and games for money conveniently with Freecash today.<br><br>Money games on Freecash are easy and fun! Play and earn with the best casual games, MMORPGs, sports games and just about every other genre available. Earn cash and crypto through amazing prize play when you play your favorite game and complete surveys for money.<br><br>It\u2019s easy to play and earn on Freecash. Here\u2019s how to get started:<br><br>1. Download the Freecash app on the Playstore.<br>2. Open the app and start your first task.<br>3. Pick from a list of casual games to play or choose a money survey and earn rewards!<br>4. Complete tasks and start making money. Some users earn more than $100 per day!<br>5. Once you finish a task, go to the shop and choose your favorite reward.<br>6. Cash out with PayPal, Bitcoin, gift cards &amp; much more INSTANTLY!<br><br>Get paid to play and test free games and apps or take a survey on the go and earn cash. Make money and earn rewards today with Freecash!<br><br>FREECASH FEATURES<br><br>\ud83c\udfae PLAY AND EARN REWARDS \ud83c\udfae<br>- Play and earn rewards in a variety of genres. From RPG, MMORPG, PvP games and more!<br>- Play and win with a variety of casual games to make money.<br>- Prize play with friends. Invite them to join Freecash with our affiliate program!<br>- Earning commissions from your friends&#39; game rewards once they join!<br><br>\u2705TAKE PAID SURVEYS AND MAKE MONEY \u2705<br>- Earn crypto and cash by completing paid surveys through one easy to use app.<br>- Earn rewards for each paid survey when you cash out.<br>- Take surveys for money from a variety of different companies.<br>- Make money by answering questions and giving feedback. It\u2019s that simple!<br><br>\ud83c\udfc6 EARN REWARDS WITH HIGH PAYOUTS \ud83c\udfc6<br>- Earn cash instantly with free PayPal gift card cashouts through our Shop.<br>- Rewards are just a few taps away with each task you complete.<br>- Freecash runs promotions with your favorite apps to guarantee the best payout as you make money!<br>- Top monthly users can earn rewards of up to $500 and daily amounts can go up to $100!<br><br>\ud83d\udcb3 EARN REWARDS, GIFT CARDS &amp; CRYPTOCURRENCY \ud83d\udcb3<br>- EARN CRYPTO: Earn Bitcoin &amp; other cryptocurrencies starting as low as only 10 cents!<br>- GIFT CARDS FOR YOUR GAMES: Earn Play Store Gift Cards and easily load your account!<br>- PAYPAL GIFT CARDS: Convert your balance to real cash!<br>- AMAZON GIFT CARDS: Add your gift card to your Amazon account balance<br><br>If you need any help, you can always get in contact with our 24/7 online support.<br><br>Playing games for money? It\u2019s possible with Freecash! Download our rewards app to earn cash and crypto today!<br><br>For complete terms, privacy and services, please visit our website: https://freecash.com/terms<br><br>Email contact: support@freecash.com",
